#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of invalid entries.
#: includes/Settings/SettingsDebug.php:2127
msgid "These entries were ignored in Allowed image hosts: %s. Enter exact hostnames such as cdn.example.com. Wildcards, leading-dot notation, IP addresses, and localhost are not supported."
